<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's LG-Caltex Oil resumes CDU operation.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's LG-Caltex Oil resumes CDU operation.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG-Caltex Oil Corp resumed operation of its No 2 crude distillation unit (CDU) on Monday after annual maintenance.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said the 130,000 barrel-per-day unit was closed down on April 15.</p>
<p>LG-Caltex, an affiliate of South Korea's LG Group, is South Korea's second-largest oil refiner with a refining capability of 600,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
